# Lake

[wireguard]
interface: listen 51820, address 10.100.0.3/16
peer Cabin: key ReplaceCabinPublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.2/32, 192.168.2.0/24], routed, endpoint cabin.example.net:51820, keepalive 25s
peer Home: key ReplaceHomePublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.1/32, 192.168.1.0/24, 10.100.10.0/24], routed, endpoint 203.0.113.10:51820, keepalive 25s
peer Phone: key ReplacePhonePublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.100/32]

[firewall]
mesh zone: input drop, output accept, forward drop

[dhcp]
